{"channelId":"UCN2F-uO_qZvMzLPlipDfLGg","row":["London College of Animal Osteopathy",1020,"London College of Animal Osteopathy (LCAO) offers world-class online training in animal osteopathy, designed for veterinarians, equine professionals, canine therapists, osteopaths, and animal care practitioners looking to advance their clinical skills and career.\n\nOur International Diploma in Animal Osteopathy provides comprehensive training in both equine osteopathy and canine osteopathy, combining evidence-based theory with practical application for real-world clinical outcomes.\n\nDelivered through a flexible, self-paced online format, our programs allow you to study from anywhere in the world, with optional hands-on clinical training (MasterClass) available in select global locations.\n\nStudents learn under the guidance of Prof. Stuart McGregor, Director of Clinical Studies, alongside an expert international faculty.\n\n Start your journey in animal osteopathy today: www.animalosteopathycollege.com","admissions@aosteocollege.com; info@aosteocollege.com","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN2F-uO_qZvMzLPlipDfLGg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN2F-uO_qZvMzLPlipDfLGg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:32.069Z","channelId":"UCN2F-uO_qZvMzLPlipDfLGg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"46fee4b0f6287e72a7e136e1348424fd027db8fa1c53804a505e157ea3dbd263","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"151b0214d2c00af9963cc94ee7a19d94fb9148c2bf935297269a02d5b1f00802"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN2F-uO_qZvMzLPlipDfLGg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:40:50.923Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN2F-uO_qZvMzLPlipDfLGg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1020,"raw":"1.02K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN2F-uO_qZvMzLPlipDfLGg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:32.069Z"}],"emails":[{"ad